# Shift+arrows carry a selection across blocks; typing or Backspace
# replaces it, and the halves join.
type one\ntwo\nthree\nfour
key Ctrl+Home Right Shift+Down Shift+Down Backspace
key Down End Shift+Up
type X
# Select All, then a word, sentence, scope and block from the menus.
key Ctrl+End
type \nsay **very loud** now. Then stop.
key Left Left Left
cmd selectLine
type Fine.
key Home Right Right Right Right Right Right Right
cmd selectScope
type quiet
cmd selectWord
type calm
key Down
type \nscratch
cmd deleteBlock
dump @OUT@
